configureCheckpoints flow:

```java
withIdempotency(request.requestId(), "CONFIGURE_CHECKPOINTS",
    orderedParams("raceId", raceId, "checkpointCodes", request.checkpointCodes(), "expectedVersion", ...),
    () -> {
        RaceRow race = requireOpenRace(raceId, expectedVersion);
        List<String> codes = request.checkpointCodes();
        if (codes == null || codes.isEmpty() || codes.size() > 20) throw BadRequest("检查点数量必须为1~20");
        // distinct & non-blank
        if (codes.stream().anyMatch(c -> c == null || c.isBlank())) throw BadRequest;
